                [ 'p', 'Requirements differ between machines, so before you switch yours on, read the manual and the xTool safety information for its exact version. xTool describes the M2 as a Class 1 device with an enclosed design. According to xTool, the F2 is a Class 4 laser for professional use: the manufacturer requires goggles even with the cover closed, training and oversight by a laser safety officer, and its instructions say not to use the F2 in public or residential places. The P3 with the conveyor feeder is a Class 4 laser, and the F2 Ultra requirements depend on the version.' ],
